# E05 Vickrey, the variant commented in its Program.cs: sequential, random order (draws from the seed of the oracle): a variant of the oracles, the original sources but its line (tests/tools/csharp-ref/ref/Oracles/VickreySeqRandom/).
# Sequential, so the C# fixes every line: the whole trace in order, the sender of a message aside ("trace"), and the
# senders as a multiset; a sender removed before its last messages are read is shown by its identifier in the C++ (a
# known divergence of the library), which "alias" pairs with its C# counterpart.
ignore ^$
cover all
fact trace ^\t?\[[^\s\]]+( -> [^\]]+\]: .*)$|^(.+)$
fact message ^\t?\[([^\s\]]+) -> ([^\]]+)\]: (.*)$
optional message
same trace seq
same message bag alias 0 ^[A-Za-z0-9]{15}$
